---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy" description="Cookie Policy for MegaTools Hub">
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8">Cookie Policy</h1>
		<div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert">
			<p>Last updated: [INSERT_DATE_HERE]</p>
			
			<h2>What are Cookies?</h2>
			<p>Cookies are small text files that are placed on your computer or mobile device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work more efficiently and provide information to the owners of the site.</p>
			
			<h2>How We Use Cookies</h2>
			<p>We use cookies primarily for:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> To understand how visitors interact with our website (e.g., Google Analytics).</li>
                <li><strong>Advertising:</strong> To serve relevant ads based on your browsing behavior (e.g., Google AdSense).</li>
                <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> To remember your settings, such as dark mode preference.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
            <p>You can control and/or delete cookies as you wish. You can delete all cookies that are already on your computer and you can set most browsers to prevent them from being placed. However, if you do this, you may have to manually adjust some preferences every time you visit a site.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
